{"parentUuid":"d1e6ccdb-2587-459d-a58f-fbb0837ea6bf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CekoL66nfkTEgmxb9QLKB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015ZuYEAvpinZSoXUuVsGLy4","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra/umbra\nexport PATH=\"$HOME/.local/share/mise/installs/go/1.26.3/bin:$PATH\"\ngo run ./internal/report/gen-site -root . >/dev/null && go test -count=1 ./... 2>&1 | grep -vE \"no test files|^ok\"\nN=$(go test -count=1 ./... -v 2>&1 | grep -c '^--- PASS'); echo \"TESTS=$N\"\nSP=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-utkuputku-Desktop-Umbra/3bf81dfa-d3b6-46f7-a67c-179a7846f14d/scratchpad\nexport NODE_PATH=/home/utkuputku/.npm-global/lib/node_modules\nnode $SP/finalqa.js \"$SP\"\ngit add -A && git -c commit.gpgsign=false commit -q -m \"umbra: phase 20 grounds, scrims and two regressions caught (tests: 320)\n\nThe halftone field shows through anything translucent, which is right\nbehind the page and wrong behind a paragraph. Every surface that carries\ntext now has a dark ground under its warm tint, and each section heading\nsits on a soft elliptical scrim, so the field reads as being behind the\npage rather than through it.\n\nTwo regressions, both found by the checks rather than by eye.\n\nThe scrim bled 118 percent of a full width heading, which is wider than\na 390px viewport, and every page gained 14px of horizontal overflow. It\ntook a bisect in the browser to find, because the first three guesses\nwere wrong: the grain, the ticker and the phase rows were all innocent.\nThe bleed is kept and the section clips it, with overflow clip rather\nthan hidden, because hidden would make the section a scroll container\nand break the sticky bar.\n\nWhich it had already done. A rule putting the content above the field\nlisted the bar among the elements it made position relative, and\nrelative quietly overrode sticky. The bar was sitting at -2990 again.\nThe bar is left out of that rule now, with a comment saying why, because\nthis is the second time it has happened.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017fqdvbHTvQuYDHifBZDVPZ\" && git log --oneline -1|cat","description":"Verify and commit the refinement pass"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":961,"cache_read_input_tokens":668560,"output_tokens":921,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":63},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":961,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":921,"cache_read_input_tokens":668560,"cache_creation_input_tokens":961,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":961},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CekoKsQYbUgodE31sGxMw","type":"assistant","uuid":"6cc73fe2-a021-4e2e-9e4e-eecfe39017d7","timestamp":"2026-09-05T18:54:18.281Z","effort":"high","session_id":"3bf81dfa-d3b6-46f7-a67c-179a7846f14d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra/umbra","sessionId":"8017734d-cdf6-4a18-b2f8-f4b5f637ec35","version":"2.1.261","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkling-waddling-dragon"}
